Name Rio Note - Misc #6 Airport Notice

Interactability_Text_Line_0 Attention all passengers!
Interactability_Text_Line_1 Due to the ongoing outbreaks happening internationally, many flights have been cancelled or delayed  indefinitely. If you were affected by these cancellations, please contact the airline responsible for your flight for further information.
Interactability_Text_Line_2 Per orders of the new Emergency Military Authority, Galeão International shall be operating international flights at a reduced capacity until further notice. For additional information, please contact costumer service.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 -Galeão International